{title: Oru Pattam Poochi}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Yesudas}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Oru [D7] Patam Buchi Nenjukulae Sutrukindrathe
Aathu Sutri Sutri Aasai Nenjai Thatukindrathe
[Gsus4] Kaathal Solla [D7] Vandaen Unidathilae,        [Gsus4] Varthai Ondrum [D7] Illai Adi Enidathile
Ada Kaathal Ithuthaanaa.        [D] Poochooda Poo Vaenu [F] maa,
[G7sus4] Poo Ingae Neethaana [D] mma,        Adi [D] Kalyaana Oorkola [F] maa,
Ini [G7sus4] Eppothum Kaarkala [D] maa,        [D7] Aaeno Manathu Unnai Kanda Pozhuthu
Kaatril Oadum Maegha Mena Aachu,        Aeno Ennaku Kaathal Vantha Piraghu
Kannaammoochi Aadumkathai Aachu,        Unnai Azhaithavan Naanae [F] Naanae
[D7] Thannai Tholaithavan Aanaen Aanaen,        Koondu Kili Ingu Naanae [F] Naanae
[D7] Vittu Viduthalai Aanaen Aanaen,        [D] Un [Dsus4] Saevai
[D] Noo [Dsus4] laaga [D] vaa [F] aa,        Naan [D] Un [Dsus4] Kunthal
[D] Poo [Dsus4] vagha [D] vaaa [F] aa,        Adi [D7] Naan Indru Nee Aagavaa
